{'symbol': 'LMT', 'date': '2021-04-21 18:07:00', 'title': 'LOCKHEED MARTIN DECLARES SECOND QUARTER 2021 DIVIDEND', 'text': 'BETHESDA, MD., APRIL 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE LOCKHEED MARTIN CORPORATION (NYSE: LMT) BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS AUTHORIZED A SECOND QUARTER 2021 DIVIDEND OF $2.60 PER SHARE.'}{'symbol': 'LMT', 'date': '2021-04-21 08:00:00', 'title': 'OROCK TECHNOLOGIES PARTNERS WITH INTEL & LOCKHEED MARTIN TO POWER HARDENED SECURITY SOLUTION, ESSENTIAL FOR SECURITY AT CLOUD SCALE', 'text': 'RESTON, VA., APRIL 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- OROCK® TECHNOLOGIES, INC., A HIGH-PERFORMANCE HYBRID CLOUD SERVICE PROVIDER BUILT ON OPENSTACK AND CERTIFIED BY FEDRAMP AND THE DEPARTMENT OF DEFENSE, TOGETHER WITH INTEL AND LOCKHEED MARTIN\xa0(NYSE: LMT)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THE AVAILABILITY OF OROCKCLOUD WITH HARDENED SECURITY, A JOINT TECHNOLOGY OFFERING THAT PROVIDES COMMERCIAL AND FEDERAL ORGANIZATIONS A NEXT-GEN SOLUTION TO ADDRESS MISSION-CRITICAL WORKLOADS AND HIGH PERFORMANCE COMPUTING (HPC) APPLICATIONS WITH GREATER SECURITY, FASTER PERFORMANCE AND PREDICTABLE LATENCY.'}